[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$C2FD(#N$C2FD),#N$AF</code>
</div>

Replaces the instruction which would otherwise take a life away when the
player is put back at the start. The new instruction clears the sign flag, so
the jump to the game over screen is never made.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C2FA(#N$C2FA)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$A721(#N$A721)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C2FD(#N$C2FD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGhl)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C2FE(#N$C2FE)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$C323</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C2FA(#N$C2FA)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$A721(#N$A721)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C2FD(#N$C2FD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">XOR #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$C2FE(#N$C2FE)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$C323</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
